  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young African Leaders Initiative (YALI) - Marigat Gold</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant will be used to support increased production and distribution of Marigat Gold honey. The project will emphasize target two types of consumers, (1) the health conscious individual who buys honey from the supermarket and (2) the low-income earner who earns a daily wage and therefore can afford the 10g sachet, which sells for 20 cents in their local kiosk. Additionally this will leader Marigat Gold to begin sourcing from an additional 50 small-holder honey farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
